WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:01.740
- Pump the music, I know how to do this.

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:03.270
I got spat on in school.

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:07.120
I was big, I was black, I was gay.

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:09.070
The day that happened,
I had to breakthrough,

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:10.910
and my breakthrough was once I stood up,

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.997
everyone else seemed like, "Oh, shit."

00:00:12.997 --> 00:00:14.610
♪ I like to, like to get down ♪

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:16.810
I'm Precious, and I'm
part of the legendary

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:18.529
Ballroom Scene of New York City.

00:00:18.529 --> 00:00:21.518
♪ Let's get some clappin'
and get this energy high ♪

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:25.480
So, Ballroom's like a huge safe haven

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:28.621
for people of LGBTQI experience.

00:00:28.621 --> 00:00:30.592
♪ Like this, don't you stop ♪

00:00:30.592 --> 00:00:32.380
♪ Make that cookie pop ♪

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:34.710
When I seen that the commentators

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:37.380
were like the center
of attention at a Ball,

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.330
I was like, "Oh, this needs to be my job."

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:41.152
♪ Walk, eat, slay ♪

00:00:41.152 --> 00:00:43.147
♪ Miss Lolita ♪

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:46.590
Growing up in the Ballroom,
you'd be surprised

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:48.850
at how many people are
gonna appreciate you

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:50.112
for being who you are.

00:00:50.112 --> 00:00:51.560
And gender non-binary for me,

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:53.280
I don't feel like I have to be like a boy,

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:54.940
or I don't feel like I have to be a girl.

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:58.250
Just think of water,
has no limits, it moves.

00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:00.960
Ooh, this orange is
sending me, Miss Honey.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.670
What can make you feel
better about yourself?

00:01:03.670 --> 00:01:05.390
For me, that was putting on makeup.

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:07.150
It gives me that touch of femininity.

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:09.150
It gives me like the
deepness of masculinity.

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:10.920
Like, my eyebrows speaks for itself.

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:13.650
It's just oh yeah, big bitch energy.

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:14.931
It's me.

00:01:14.931 --> 00:01:16.832
♪ Do you wanna take a bite ♪

00:01:16.832 --> 00:01:18.600
♪ Of this cookie ♪

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:21.510
I want to be known for
someone who uplifted people

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:22.660
across the world.

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:24.720
And for me that was getting on the mic.

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:25.720
'Cause I can get on the mic

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:27.900
and I can give you something you can feel.

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:30.221
And Ballroom helped me
with that, trust me.

00:01:30.221 --> 00:01:31.501
♪ All my people had to fight ♪

00:01:31.501 --> 00:01:32.334
♪ But without a fight ♪

00:01:32.334 --> 00:01:34.211
♪ There wouldn't have been no success ♪

00:01:34.211 --> 00:01:36.106
♪ Hi, my name is Precious ♪

00:01:36.106 --> 00:01:39.143
♪ Let me get this off my chest ♪

00:01:39.143 --> 00:01:41.560
(logo dings)

